 triage:action "List ADR-RUN-0019 in C5 governing ADRs and retain its native-port/no-reverse-adapter constraints; update coverage for any further genuinely applicable ADRs." ;
 triage:fix_disposition "Governing ADR-RUN-0019 and public panic ADR-RUN-0006 added to C5 frontmatter." ;
