triage:C5_QA1_RSH_C5_001 a triage:Finding ;
 triage:id "RSH-C5-001" ;
 triage:severity "critical" ;
 triage:reviewer "rust-service-hardening-agent" ;
 triage:status "fixed" ;
 triage:reviewed_commit "f7d58b1c8556b55fcff744cfa3e3c5775521b795" ;
 triage:file "crates/sc-cron/src/operation.rs" ;
 triage:issue "Independent expiry notification depends on the thread calling request_stop being inside a Tokio runtime." ;
 triage:action "Schedule deadline notification using a retained owner/runtime or another owned mechanism independent of the caller thread. Keep earlier G/K cutoffs and second-stop shortening live. Add a causal normal-thread request_stop test with a native operation held beyond G and a status subscriber that observes expiry before join or releasing the native gate." ;
 triage:fix_disposition "Retained owning runtime schedules stop expiry independently of ordinary caller thread; held admitted native COMMIT regression and original-behavior negative." ;
 triage:verification_source "https://github.com/randlee/sc-runtime/pull/118#issuecomment-6647574110" .

triage:C5_QA1_RSH_C5_002 a triage:Finding ;
 triage:id "RSH-C5-002" ;
 triage:severity "critical" ;
 triage:reviewer "rust-service-hardening-agent" ;
 triage:status "fixed" ;
 triage:reviewed_commit "f7d58b1c8556b55fcff744cfa3e3c5775521b795" ;
 triage:file "crates/sc-cron/src/operation.rs" ;
 triage:issue "Physical completion accounting belongs to an abortable async task rather than to the native blocking operation." ;
 triage:action "Keep the physical accounting/permit guard alive inside the actual blocking execution or an equivalent owner that survives cancellation of the caller runtime. Retain physical completion and reconciliation until that execution ends. Add a causal SDK regression holding a native closure while its caller runtime is shut down, proving the permit stays occupied and join/status cannot claim completion until the held closure is released and actually finishes." ;
 triage:fix_disposition "Physical accounting guard moves into actual blocking closure; retained join registry and runtime-worker-stop handshake prove occupied permit until native completion." ;
 triage:verification_source "https://github.com/randlee/sc-runtime/pull/118#issuecomment-6647574110" .

triage:C5_QA1_RSH_C5_003 a triage:Finding ;
